  "changes": {
    "bubbles": "50% filtered original artwork and 50% continuous rounded-body/rim lighting with less saturated highlights, gated by original alpha and derived cluster silhouette. Half authored additive/quarter-additive light plus half continuously lit body, composed after ABR scaling. Up to 50% extinction per layer follows authored envelope and soft intersections in both fast and precise Vulkan replay. Trajectory stays native.",
    "submarine": "Original SubEfct projection and STP retained. Authored reflected light gain 1.65 plus restrained highlight lift driven by source artwork luminance; no new cellular pattern.",
    "crt": "Intermediate CRT: authored pedestal scaled 0.82 red / 0.60 green, narrower beam 0.34..0.70, optical white point 0.37 red / 0.27 green, scene RGB preserved. Red shadow readability retained; green has deeper contrast than revision 5.",
    "unchanged": "Water refraction/depth fog, snow and gameplay goggles retain revision-4 behavior."
  },
